    "updated_at": "2021-06-17T08:30:38Z",
    "body": "Once fetching is better defined we can handle this there and add a taint bit to the data as appropriate. In principle objects are \"same origin\" in the sense that if you have access to an object you should be able to use it. (Some objects are nevertheless annotated with an origin, but this generally isn't a design objects should follow.)",
